  <entity00401731:DescriptionOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesByEachSegmentOfDisclosureOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesByEachSegmentOfDisclosureOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesByEachSegmentTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2024dTQ_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">보고부문의 자산ㆍ부채 금액은 내부거래 제거 전이며, 공통 자산과 부채를 부문별 영업에 근거해 배부한 후의 금액입니다.</entity00401731:DescriptionOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesByEachSegmentOfDisclosureOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesByEachSegmentOfDisclosureOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesByEachSegmentTableOfItems>
