  <entity00401731:DescriptionOfStockPurchaseContractsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dTQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_DerivativesTypeAxis_ifrs-full_OptionContractMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_entity00401731_CybellumTechnologiesLtdOfEntitysTotalForSubsidiariesMemberOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">회사는 Cybellum Technologies Ltd.의 주주 및 Stock Option이 부여된 직원에 대한 Put Option 부여함에 따라 파생상품부채 27,848백만원을 인식하였고, 2025년 3분기 누적기간 중 동 계약에 대한 파생상품거래손익은 없습니다.</entity00401731:DescriptionOfStockPurchaseContractsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsTableOfItems>
