  <entity00401731:DescriptionOfCurrencySwapContractOfDisclosureOfDerivativesForNonHedgingPurposesOfDisclosureOfDerivativesForNonHedgingPurposesTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dTQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_DerivativesTypeAxis_ifrs-full_SwapContractMember_dart_DerivativeContractTypeAxis_dart_ForeignCurrencyRelatedMember" xml:lang="ko">회사는 외화단기차입금에 대한 통화스왑계약을 체결하였으며, 이에 대한 위험회피회계를 적용하지 않음에 따라 파생상품거래손실 26,460백만원을 인식하였습니다. 당분기 중 외화단기차입금을 상환하였고 해당 통화스왑계약은 종료하였습니다.</entity00401731:DescriptionOfCurrencySwapContractOfDisclosureOfDerivativesForNonHedgingPurposesOfDisclosureOfDerivativesForNonHedgingPurposesTableOfItems>
